  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>Dividend Guide is a static informational website. We do not require user accounts or collect personal information for accounts. Optional Google Analytics loads only after you explicitly accept analytics in the consent banner; if you decline, no analytics request is sent.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Analytics is disabled until you consent. Your preference is stored locally so we can remember your choice. We do not use advertising cookies. Functional browser storage may be used for calculator preferences and does not track you across sites.</p>
  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>We may link to external financial data providers and news sources. Once you leave Dividend Guide, those sites have their own privacy policies. We recommend reviewing them.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@dividend01.com">hello@dividend01.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>Change Your Choice</h2>
  <p>To change your analytics choice, clear the site's local storage in your browser or contact us for help. We do not use analytics data to provide personalized financial advice.</p>
